    <Mask>
      <Type>Model of an SMF </Type>
      <Display/>
      <Description>This model solves the NLSE for pulse propagation in an optical fiber using the SSF (Split Step Fourier) method 
The following effects are included: group velocity dispersion (GVD), higher order dispersion, loss, and self-phase modulation (gamma)</Description>
